<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@/~part_III__cl_20__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "Where the Court receives an application under subsection (1), it may appoint an auditor to examine such entries in the books and accounts of the trust company and the auditor shall report his findings to the Court."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@> .
