<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@/~part_III__cl_21__subsec_2> <https://schema.org/text> "A trust company which fails to comply with the requirement of subsection (1) and every officer of that trust company who is in default shall be guilty of an offence against this Act. Penalty: Thirty thousand ringgit or five years imprisonment or both."@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@> .
