<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@/~part_III__cl_22__subsec_1__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "where it holds an estate on behalf of any person, to receive out of the estate a commission, in addition to all moneys properly expended by the trust company and fees payable to it and charge- able against the estate; and"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@/~part_III__cl_22__subsec_1__para_b> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@/~part_III__cl_22__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@> .
