<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@/~part_II__cl_12> <https://schema.org/name> "Where any trust company is appointed either alone"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@> .
