<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@/~part_I__cl_9__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Any officer of the trust company who, in supplying any information as required under subsection (2), know- ingly or recklessly makes any statement which is false in any material particular shall be guilty of an offence against this Act. Penalty: Three thousand ringgit,"@en <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1990/29/eng@> .
